---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ExternalIcon from '../assets/images/icon-external.svg';
import '../styles/About.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Arun Kumar Anguraja | @aka"
  description="Arun Kumar Anguraja - Principal Software Engineer in Bangalore, working across SAP, .NET MAUI and Azure, and running a farm on the side."
>
  <div class="About">
    <h1>Arun Kumar Anguraja</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Arun Kumar Anguraja, a Principal Software Engineer based in Bangalore. I was born in a
      small town near Salem, Tamil Nadu, and grew up in Pondicherry, where I completed my B.Tech in
      Computer Science and Engineering.
    </p>
    <p>
      Over the past twelve years, I've built a career around UI development — starting with SAPUI5
      at Merck and SAP Labs, where I led projects spanning React, Node.js, and even a chatbot built
      on Google's DialogFlow and Microsoft's LUIS. Since joining West Pharmaceutical Services in
      2019 — first as Lead Software Engineer, now as Principal Software Engineer — I've shifted
      focus toward Microsoft technologies, including .NET MAUI and Azure Cloud, and hold
      certifications in Machine Learning and AI.
    </p>
    <p>
      Technology and agriculture intersect in my life in a very literal way: I own a farm back home,
      and my wife (also in IT) collaborates with me on farm-tech projects. It's where I get to apply
      problem-solving to something outside a screen.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of work, I travel, cook, and read — I started with <em>Ikigai</em> and haven't stopped
      since.
    </p>
    <p>
      My goal is to grow into a solution architect role and eventually build my own technology
      company — one that uses tech to genuinely help people.
    </p>

    <h2 class="About-heading">What I've Built</h2>

    <div class="Work">
      <article class="Work-item">
        <h3>
          Enterprise Platform — <a
            href="https://www.westpharma.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >West Pharmaceutical Services<ExternalIcon class="Work-link-icon" aria-hidden="true"
            /></a
          >
        </h3>
        <p>
          Led an enterprise application from the ground up, now used by 5,000+ employees. Built a
          cross-platform .NET MAUI app with a companion config tool (cutting admin overhead 50%),
          integrated SAP Logon and SAP APIs (boosting operational efficiency 25%), and digitized
          100+ business processes (reducing manual effort 60%). Directing a team of 15 developers
          across UI, ABAP, and Azure App Services. Completed an AI &amp; Deep Learning certification
          (360DigiTMG) and launched AI-powered tools, boosting development productivity 15-20%.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="Work-item">
        <h3>
          NEXTERP — <a
            href="https://www.merckmillipore.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Merck<ExternalIcon class="Work-link-icon" aria-hidden="true" /></a
          >
        </h3>
        <p>
          Led development of a cross-platform enterprise suite (60+ apps, 700+ modules) built on
          SAPUI5, moving Merck's ERP experience to mobile, tablet, and web. Also built a full-stack
          chatbot using Google DialogFlow and Microsoft LUIS.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="Work-item">
        <h3>
          C3 (Customer Care Connect) — <a
            href="https://www.lavamobiles.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >Lava International<ExternalIcon class="Work-link-icon" aria-hidden="true" /></a
          >
        </h3>
        <p>
          Converted a legacy Web Dynpro CRM application to SAPUI5, cutting server load and tripling
          application speed — while designing a secure custom login/password-reset flow.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="Work-item">
        <h3>
          Apprentice Management — <a
            href="https://www.sap.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">SAP Labs<ExternalIcon class="Work-link-icon" aria-hidden="true" /></a
          >
        </h3>
        <p>
          Optimized OData and DWR call performance for SAP SuccessFactors' employee central module,
          supporting 1,000+ end users.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="Work-item">
        <h3>Farm-Tech Projects — Independent</h3>
        <p>
          Ongoing collaboration with my wife applying technology to agriculture on our family farm —
          bridging enterprise software experience with real-world problem-solving outside the
          corporate stack.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
